program	conformance/N10_align_rejects_non_power_of_two.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	`@align` on the local `body` must be a power of two, but is `24`
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: `@align` on the local `body` must be a power of two, but is `24`"
log	"  --> examples/conformance/N10_align_rejects_non_power_of_two.saw:12:12"
log	"     |"
log	" 12 |     @align(24)"
log	"     |            ^"
log	"   hint: an address is aligned to a power of two — the nearest are `16` and `32`"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
